                        Download Brochure
                    </button>
                
                <button class="btn back-btn btn-default open-common-lead-form" enStr= "">
                    <em class="icon-call-b"></em>
                    Talk to Expert
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
            <p>Find the right home at Puravankara Northern Lights in Bagalur, Bangalore. Browse 3 BHK floor plans, compare 1,097 – 4,131 sq.ft, view layouts and room placements in 2D or 3D, watch 3D videos, check Vaastu, and estimate interiors.</p>
        
    </div>
</section>

<section class="configuration-section">
    <div class="configuration-box">
        <div class="container">
            <strong class="heading">Pick your configuration</strong>
            <p class="sub-heading">1 configuration available.</p>
            <ul class="tab-box scrollbar-hide">
                
                
                    <li class="active" data-bhk="3">3 BHK (1)</li>
                
            </ul>
            
            <div class="bhk-type-tabbox scrollbar-hide" id="fpConfigCards">
                
                    <div class="bhk-type-tab selected" data-index="0" data-bhk="3">
                        <div class="bhk-tab-header">
                            <em class="icon-check-o"></em>
                            <div class="bhk-card-pricebox">
                                <strong class="card-name">3 BHK 1685 Sq. Ft. Apartment</strong>
                            </div>
                            <span class="bhk-tab-badge ">₹ 1.85 Cr.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fp-card-area-row">
                            
                                <div class="fp-card-area-item">
                                    <span class="fp-card-area-label">Saleable</span>
                                    <span class="fp-card-area-value">1,685 sq. ft</span>
                                </div>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                        
                    </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="panel-detail-box">
            <div class="panel-left-box">
         <div class="section-badge" id="fpDetailBhkType">3 BHK 1685 Sq. Ft. Apartment</div>
            <h2 class="heading" id="fpDetailHeading">
                Spacious 3 BHK Grand Apartment at Puravankara Northern Lights
                        
            </h2>
                <p class="panel-description" id="fpDetailDesc">
                    This 3 BHK residence at Puravankara Northern Lights is centered around an expansive 22-foot living and dining hall that serves as the heart of the home. The layout emphasizes privacy with a dedicated entry foyer and a split-bedroom configuration that separates the master suite from guest quarters. Practicality is integrated through a deep galley kitchen with an attached utility and ample en-suite facilities.
                            
                </p>
                <div class="property-bhk-container">
                            

    
                            
                            <div class="allkeys-bhk">
                                <strong class="small-heading">What makes this home stand out</strong>
                                <ul class="highlights-list" id="fpDetailHighlights">
                                    
                                        
                                            <li>Expansive 12'0" x 22'0" Living and Dining hall</li>
                                            
                                            <li>Dual private balconies for master and living areas</li>
                                            
                                            <li>Dedicated entry foyer for enhanced hallway privacy</li>
                                            
                                            <li>Three full bathrooms including two en-suites</li>
                                            
                                            <li>Functional kitchen with integrated utility space</li>
                                            
                                                
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="aminity-card-box">
                                
                                    <div class="aminity-card">
                                        <em class="icon-bed"></em>
                                        <div class="aminity-card-content">
                                            <span class="label">Configuration</span>
                                            <span class="value" id="fpDetailConfig">
                                                3 BHK
                                            </span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    
                                        
                                                
                                                    <div class="aminity-card">
                                                        <em class="icon-config"></em>
                                                        <div class="aminity-card-content">
                                                            <span class="label">Saleable</span>
                                                            <span class="value" id="fpDetailSaleable">
                                                                1,685 sq.ft
                                                            </span>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    
                                                        
                                                            <div class="aminity-card" id="fpDetailBathroomChip" >
                                                                    <em class="icon-bathroom"></em>
                                                                    <div class="aminity-card-content">
                                                                        <span class="label">Bathrooms</span>
                                                                        <span class="value" id="fpDetailBathroomVal">
                                                                            3
                                                                        </span>
                                                                    </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            
                                                                
                                                                    <div class="aminity-card" id="fpDetailBalconyChip" >
                                                                            <em class="icon-stairs"></em>
                                                                            <div class="aminity-card-content">
                                                                                <span class="label">Balconies</span>
                                                                                <span class="value" id="fpDetailBalconyVal">
                                                                                    2
                                                                                </span>
                                                                            </div>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                    
                            </div>
                        </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>
